h","merged_at":"2025-04-28T00:27:06Z"},"body":"- Related: godotengine/godot-cpp#1150\r\n\r\nTaking heavy inspiration from the above PR, this aims to consolidate `CharString` and `Char16String` with a common template core: `CharStringT`. Not only does this have the benefit of code uniformity, but it also gives us access to new character string classes: `CharWideString` & `Char32String` (Also `Char8String` when `char8_t` is eventually supported). The only major changes from the godot-cpp implementation were making some functions inlined where possible & adding equality operators.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98439/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98439/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}